<p align="center" style=" text-align: center;   "><span style="Times New Roman&quot;; ">〔2026〕</span><span style=" ">2</span><span style="Times New Roman&quot;; ">26号</span></p>
<p align="center" style=" text-align: center;   "><span style="Times New Roman&quot;; "><br />
</span></p>
<p style=" text-align: justify;    ">　　<span style=" ">根据《上海期货交易所厂库交割管理办法》《上海期货交易所螺纹钢期货业务细则》等有关规定，经研究决定：</span>&nbsp;</p>
<p style=" text-align: justify;    ">　　<span style=" ">同意江苏省镔鑫钢铁集团有限公司增加中储南京作为螺纹钢期货交割厂库基准提货地，调整后提货地等信息见附件。</span>&nbsp;</p>
<p style=" text-align: justify;    ">　　<span style=" ">各有关单位应高度重视，切实做好各项工作，确保交割业务的正常有序进行。</span>&nbsp;</p>
<p style=" text-align: justify;    ">　　<span style=" ">特此公告。</span>&nbsp;</p>
<p style=" text-align: justify;    ">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=" text-align: justify;    ">　　<a href="./W020261019554076467964.doc" oldsrc="W020261019554076467964.doc"><span style=" ">附件：螺纹钢期货交割</span><span style="Times New Roman&quot;; ">厂库</span><span style=" ">提货地</span><span style="Times New Roman&quot;; ">等</span><span style=" ">信息</span>&nbsp;</a></p>
<p align="right" style=" text-align: right;   ">　</p>
<p align="right" style=" text-align: right;   ">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="right" style=" text-align: right;   ">　<span style="Times New Roman&quot;; ">上海期货交易所</span></p>
<p style="text-align: right;">　　<span style="Times New Roman&quot;; ">2026年10月19日</span></p>
</div>
